# Why Interpolation Is Usually Preferred

This:

```ruby id="xmlns238"
"#{first_name} #{last_name}"
```

is cleaner than:

```ruby id="xmlns239"
first_name + " " + last_name
```

Especially for long strings.

That’s why interpolation is heavily used in Ruby/Rails.

